.<br>  <br>If a place is <u>nearby</u>, you use yards to say how far it is.<br> If a place is <u>far</u>, you use miles to say how far it is.<br>  <br>You can say the altitude when you talk about how far up somewhere is on a mountain. You use the phrase \u201cabove sea level\u201d to talk about altitude.<br>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imperial System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Metric System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 mile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1.6 kilometers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 yard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"90 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 foot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"30 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 inch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2.5 centimeters\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "How far is the mountain from here?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's 12 miles away.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hidden", "type": "name"}, {"content": "secret; out of view", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Machu Picchu was hidden for 400 years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le15ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear on a tour of Machu Picchu.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "jungle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area with many trees and tropical plants ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Machu Picc