mportant is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn4le15ob03re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le15ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">John introduces Machu Picchu to the group.</span>", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Machu Picchu is an ancient Inca city. Sitting on top of a high mountain, it is a very beautiful and interesting place. Machu Picchu is called \"the lost city\" because it was hidden in the jungle for 400 years. No one knew where it was until Hiram Bingham found it in 1911.", "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "For the Incas, this city was a religious center. They built beautiful stone temples there and prayed in them. Today we can still see the ruins of these incredible buildings. They help us imagine what the Inca world was like a long time ago. The altitude is 7870 feet above sea level, so the air is very thin - there is a danger of getting altitude sickness, so take it slow.", "time": "21000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le15ob03re1img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Machu Picchu is an ancient Inca city. Sitting on top of a high mountain, it is a very beautiful and interesting place. Machu Picchu is called \"The Lost City\" because it was hidden in the jungle for 400 years. No one knew where it was until Hiram Bingham found it in 1911.\nFor the Incas, this city was a religious center. They built beautiful stone temples there and prayed in them.", "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "Today we can still see the ruins of these incredible buildings. They help us imagine what the Inca world was like a long time ago. The altitude is 7870 feet above sea level, so the air is very thin. There is a danger of getting altitude sickness, so take it slow.", "time": "25000"}], "video_src": "engenn4le15ob03re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}